### Implementation Details

**File: `src/App.jsx`**
```javascript
import { SpeedInsights } from "@vercel/speed-insights/react"

export default function App() {
  return (
    <>
      <Analytics />
      <SpeedInsights />
      <RouterProvider router={router} />
    </>
  )
}
```

This follows the official Vercel Speed Insights quickstart guide for React applications, which specifies to add the `<SpeedInsights />` component to your root component.

